1
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,160
3 Months Later

2
00:02:19,575 --> 00:02:22,405
Near Yalakova

3
00:02:43,382 --> 00:02:50,292
Visit turkision.com for more!

4
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,839
Praise be to the army.

5
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:13,559
There will be Turkmen tents
throughout seaside of Yalakova.

6
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:17,679
Today is the day.

7
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:24,159
Bursa will be surely
conquered when the time comes.

8
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:27,999
We are sure of that. However..

9
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:31,959
..if we do not prevent the support
that will come from Constantinople..

10
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:35,279
We will not be victorious..

11
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:38,199
..in the siege.

12
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,639
We need to lift the siege..

13
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,359
..for every support that comes, my Bey.

14
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:48,519
-We need to secure the roads.
-Before the siege..

15
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:52,639
..Yoruks, Armutlu, Cinarcik..

16
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:56,399
..and Yalakova will be where they will camp.

17
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,359
They will stay there .

18
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:04,559
Orhan, did Gunduz Bey's alps settle in Yalakova?

19
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:08,919
They are on their duty to
ensure Yoruks' safety, my Bey.

20
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:11,679
-Good.
-Our other alps are at Armutlu.

21
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,759
They are taking precautions, my Bey.

22
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,398
These places that we are camping..

23
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:21,077
..will start closing off in
the shape of a crescent.

24
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,919
That way..

25
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:27,279
..siege of Bursa will begin.

26
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,479
If Allah permits.

27
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:33,039
We are taking every precaution on land.

28
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,159
They still have the seas.

29
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,879
We will continue the siege.

30
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,999
And here, Karesi Bey..

31
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:44,079
..you will have a lot to do.

32
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,959
I am honored by your invitation, Osman Bey.

33
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:50,759
However, we've lost a huge part of the fleet..

34
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,719
..from the attacks of Katalan.

35
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,879
Our ships are not enough..

36
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:01,759
-..to stop Byzantine ships.
-If this was easy..

37
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:04,159
..everyone would've conquered Bursa.

38
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,799
Alaeddin Bey arrived at the lands of Karesi..

39
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,159
..to complete the shortcomings
of the fleet, my Bey.

40
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:13,999
He took blacksmiths and wood craftsmen with him.

41
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:17,119
Good. Now..

42
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,839
..Karesi Bey, we will stop all the help..

43
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,079
..coming from the sea.

44
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,759
And all of the treasure here..

45
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:27,559
..will be Karesiogullari's treasures.

46
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,279
May you prosper.

47
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:32,239
May you prosper, Osman Bey.

48
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:35,399
Either on land or sea..

49
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:38,959
..Turks always fight.

50
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,879
Yes.

51
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:47,279
We will either be martyrs for this cause..

52
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,679
..or Bursa will be ours.

53
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:59,199
There is no other way.

54
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:33,159
Where is the gold?

55
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:37,319
There is no gold. We are paying our taxes.

56
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:43,319
No., gold..

57
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,639
Don't do this!

58
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,599
We are already paying our taxes!

59
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,439
We do not have the power
to give war taxes anymore!

60
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,399
Have mercy!

61
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:20,719
This injustice acts of yours
will be your end someday.

62
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:10,799
People of Bursa are not happy with war taxes.

63
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:13,399
If we lose people's support-

64
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,599
To hell with the people!

65
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:20,599
I came here with the permit from the Emperor.

66
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:24,759
The sheep of Jesus will either give their wool..

67
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,439
..or their meat!

68
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:31,719
Osman is getting ready to cut our
connections with Constantinople..

69
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,719
..before attacking Bursa!

70
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:38,599
If they want to leave
safely, they will pay the price.

71
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:54,479
Soldier.

72
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:06,359
All of you want to chew on
this juicy Bursa peach, right?

73
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:21,799
However, know that this amazing taste..

74
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:27,119
..comes from the core of the peach!

75
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:30,879
This core is the army of Byzantine itself!

76
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:34,639
You are here because the army is here!

77
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:38,199
If the army is gone, then
you will all starve to death!

78
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,919
This is a robbery! Will you take our lives too?

79
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,639
We don't have the means to hold on anymore.

80
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:46,279
Please, have mercy. Our businesses..

81
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,879
..are on the verge of ending.

82
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:51,519
You will end businesses! Don't do this!

83
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:57,079
No mercy!

84
00:09:57,160 --> 00:10:00,239
I will pull each of your teeth out..

85
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:03,839
..that wants to bite this juicy fruit!

86
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:06,759
Open shields!

87
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:49,959
Don't be afraid. Run to your home.

88
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,319
Come on, run to your mother.

89
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,319
Come on.

90
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,159
Come on.

91
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:03,679
We need to tell Osman Bey what happened. Let's go.

92
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:16,959
-A letter for Osman Bey.
-Boran.

93
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:47,999
The letter is from Constantin Paleologus.

94
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,759
The dog who ordered to kill Gunduz Bey.

95
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:56,599
-What does he want, my Beys?
-He says he speaks with the emperor's order.

96
00:11:56,680 --> 00:12:01,119
He wants to meet and talk.

97
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:05,719
-That's what we want.
-They know every step of ours, my Bey.

98
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,199
Yes, they do.

99
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,639
But they also know what we'll do to them.

100
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:14,039
He's now inviting the one
who he desired to kill once.

101
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,079
He wants to meet...

102
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:19,359
...the one who he wanted to kill.

103
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,279
Let's see him.

104
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:24,239
-Will we meet him, my Bey?
-Yes.

105
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:28,199
We will meet Constantin.

106
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:31,479
To stop us,

107
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:35,199
...he will certainly try several tricks.

108
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:39,279
In fact, he will even attempt to kill us.

109
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,239
Yet I can't wait for Bursa's conquest...

110
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:45,119
...to avenge Gunduz Bey.

111
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:50,439
I will decide even the commander who is going
to be my enemy during the conquest of Bursa.

112
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:54,679
This man is too vile to be my enemy.

113
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,359
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

114
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:59,079
You and I will go to Bursa.

115
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:03,959
There's been no news from Holofira for long.
We need to find out how she's been doing.

116
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:06,519
As you order, my Bey.

117
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:11,159
Giddap! Giddap!

118
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:16,559
Mercy is a huge lie, Aleksios.

119
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:19,919
The only solution would be a sharp sword.

120
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:30,439
If Osman doesn't come around

121
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:35,039
...he will face my sword's sharp side.

122
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,439
Even if he accepts your invitation,

123
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:42,959
...he won't have an agreement
with you, Commander Constantin.

124
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:46,079
I invited Osman to
get to know him...

125
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:51,239
...and kill him at the first
chance, not to have an agreement.

126
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,839
If Osman dies in Bursa,

127
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,839
...our honor will be ruined.

128
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:01,239
People will see us as cowards.

129
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:05,839
Honor... It's a stupid word.

130
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:10,199
When Osman destroys the city walls,

131
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:13,719
...there will be no honor and people left.

132
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:17,279
Besides, it's not me who will kill Osman.

133
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,639
He won't be killed in the palace.

134
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:23,679
It will look like people lynched him.

135
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:31,799
Now it's time to talk to my beloved cousin
Holofira who I haven't seen for long years.

136
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,719
When I last saw her she was a little kid.

137
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:43,119
She's not a kid anymore.

138
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:46,759
She is a smart woman with a sharp mind.

139
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:53,359
We'll see whether she'll serve
her own kin with her mind...

140
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,959
...or serve goat shepherds.

141
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,959
Let's go.

142
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:14,959
Well... Thank You, my Allah.

143
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:25,239
-Scholar.
-My dear.

144
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:33,119
Shall we race to the tribe?

145
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:38,559
-What? Do you miss your tribe?
-Yes, a lot.

146
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:43,519
You'll eat my dust then. For your information.

147
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:49,759
You can't beat me this time, Scholar.

148
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,399
You say so?

149
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:55,199
-Yes.
-Fine.

150
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:58,239
Let's see, Trickster Hatun.

151
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,719
We'll see, Scholar.

152
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:04,839
-To the water source in the valley then.
-Alright.

153
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:09,639
-Fine. Here we go.
-Here we go.

154
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:21,679
-Hasan.
-My Shahzade.

155
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:27,119
Tell the other tribes to meet the needs
of the iron mongers and carpenters...

156
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:29,279
...who we brought from Karesi lands.

157
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,679
As you order, my Shahzade.

158
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:34,679
Fine. Here we go. Be careful.

159
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:38,599
Let's go, Trickster Hatun.

160
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:59,799
You've got slow since we got married, Scholar.

161
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:05,079
No. This isn't the case. I just let my wife win.

162
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:08,919
Oh come on. Can't you just admit that you lost?

163
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:12,679
Well, my dear... You win.

164
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:16,919
Tell me. What do you want from your husband?

165
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,679
I want nothing.

166
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,479
This was our last horse race.

167
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:26,759
Oh really? Why is that?

168
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:31,759
I'll tell you. But promise not to yell.

169
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:34,559
Just say it.

170
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:40,399
Great news, Alaaddin Bey.

171
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,399
What news, Gonca?

172
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:44,399
-Alaaddin.
-Yes, my dear?

173
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:49,719
-I can't ride a horse anymore.
-What is the matter?

174
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,279
Alaaddin...

175
00:18:57,560 --> 00:19:00,999
I'm pregnant. We're going to have a baby.

176
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,879
Pregnant?

177
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,879
-Pregnant...
-I'm pregnant.

178
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:25,119
We're going to have a baby.

179
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:36,399
What are you saying, my Gonca?

180
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:50,839
I am... -You are pregnant.
-I am pregnant.

181
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,559
Allah!

182
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:06,959
My Allah, thanks to You!

183
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:10,399
Stop... stop...

184
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:13,639
You are pregnant... I am going to be a father.

185
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:17,799
I am going to be a father... What should
I do now, my Gonca? What should I do?

186
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,764
I'll go and wash
my face, Gonca.

187
00:20:19,776 --> 00:20:21,359
Where are you going, Alaeddin?

188
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:25,079
I'll go and wash my face, Gonca..
-Alaeddin...

189
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:32,279
We are going to have a child!

190
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,479
Stop, what are you doing?

191
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:38,119
Alaeddin...
-We are going to have a baby.

192
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,799
Allah..

193
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:46,679
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

194
00:21:27,840 --> 00:21:30,439
Welcome to Kayi's property, Yakup Bey.

195
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:33,279
It is Osman Bey's order. From now on...

196
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:35,399
...when you come to the marketplace...

197
00:21:35,600 --> 00:21:38,279
...your Alps will leave their swords, Yakup Bey.

198
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:41,159
Why do you take our Alps' sword, huh?

199
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:44,959
How dare you?
-Osman Bey's property...

200
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:48,119
...Osman's laws, Mehmet Bey!

201
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:52,559
We will come to collect taxes tomorrow
we came here to let you know that.

202
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:55,719
I did not come here to fight with you.

203
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:57,119
Move!

204
00:21:57,280 --> 00:22:01,079
Swords, Yakup Bey.

205
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:33,399
As if giving taxes to Osman is not enough...

206
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:37,479
...now they are treating us like this.

207
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:42,959
They say we can't trade with anyone else..

208
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:46,519
He said he would stop us from trading with...

209
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:48,759
..Bursa and Iznik.

210
00:22:49,080 --> 00:22:50,088
Arrogant man...

211
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:53,159
Now you cannot trade with
Byzantium as well, father.

212
00:22:53,360 --> 00:22:57,359
And now Yoruks are also
pledging allegiance to him.

213
00:22:57,640 --> 00:23:01,159
All tribes see Osman Bey as
a spiritual leader, my Sultan.

214
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:04,439
He has no spirituality. -Right.

215
00:23:04,520 --> 00:23:08,479
He is enlarging his treasury with those raids.

216
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:11,359
He is feeding people...

217
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:14,399
...and he also takes those things from us.
-We did not...

218
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:16,679
...come here for gold, Mehmet.

219
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,839
Trade is just an excuse.

220
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:22,119
We are not here to be humiliated.

221
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:24,559
I know what I will do to him.

222
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:29,919
This is Yakup Bey's word.

223
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:58,959
Bala.. -Welcome, my Bey.
-Thank you.

224
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:09,639
So? Where are Alaeddin and
Gonca? Haven't they returned yet?

225
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:14,159
They are coming, my Bey!

226
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:34,079
There is something strange.

227
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:41,319
What happened, Alaeddin? Gonca?

228
00:24:43,320 --> 00:24:47,079
I have good news, my Bey.

229
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:56,559
Now we will put another plate on our table.

230
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:58,599
What?

231
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:08,399
With Allah's consent, we
will have a child, my Bey.

232
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:11,639
Praise be, this is such good news!

233
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:15,159
Praise be.

234
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:17,639
My daughter...

235
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:26,159
May it be blessed..
-Thank you mother.

236
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:30,079
-May it be blessed. May it be blessed.
-Thank you my Bey.

237
00:25:30,320 --> 00:25:33,039
Mother... -My son..

238
00:25:33,360 --> 00:25:36,479
My daughter... May it be blessed.
-Thank you, my Bey...

239
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:39,159
Praise be, praise be.

240
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:42,351
I hope you will come
together with your child safely.

241
00:25:42,363 --> 00:25:43,479
I hope so, mother.

242
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:50,039
-Brother..
-My lion brother..

243
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:53,999
May Allah let you raise your child in pace.

244
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:57,279
Boran Bey...

245
00:25:58,320 --> 00:26:01,679
Praise be.

246
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:06,159
So, Boran.. -My Bey!

247
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:10,519
Sacrifice 40 animals and
distribute them to the people!

248
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:13,599
Kayi is expecting a grandchild!

249
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:15,999
Yes my Bey!

250
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:21,759
May it be blessed. -Thank you.

251
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:26,039
Now I am going to be an aunt, huh?

252
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,959
What am I going to be then?

253
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:33,199
I am going to be an uncle!

254
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:36,799
Right, right... Little uncle...

255
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:40,119
Come on Ulgen... We have to set a well-prepared...

256
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:42,567
...table after this news, huh?

257
00:26:42,579 --> 00:26:44,879
We will set the best of it.

258
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:49,119
Let's go inside.

259
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:58,039
Now, they say girls look like their aunt..

260
00:26:58,120 --> 00:27:00,359
...and boys look like their uncle.

261
00:27:00,360 --> 00:27:02,359
I hope she will look like me, huh?

262
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:04,439
Why would he look like that big Mehmet?

263
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:05,839
Huh? That's not true.

264
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:09,439
If it's a girl, she will look like you,
if it's a boy, he will look like me.

265
00:27:09,560 --> 00:27:13,159
Right... One Mehmet is enough for me.

266
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,519
He will look like his uncle for sure.

267
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:19,959
But... One Fatma is also enough, brother.

268
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:24,519
Brother... I am offended.

269
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:28,439
Wait, aunt, wait...

270
00:27:28,600 --> 00:27:30,439
Why are you carrying that?

271
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:33,479
What harm could this little
thing possibly do, Fatma?

272
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:38,919
You are pregnant! Why are you being stubborn?

273
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:50,479
Oh praise be... Praise be.

274
00:27:52,640 --> 00:27:55,879
What a beautiful table you have set...

275
00:27:57,440 --> 00:28:01,519
Thanks to Allah. We are growing day by day.

276
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:05,719
Right... Thanks to Allah
Who let us see these days.

277
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:09,079
Come on now, sit down. -Come on.

278
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:17,199
My Bey, Biiznillah we sacrificed our
animals and distributed them to our people.

279
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:19,559
Good, good.

280
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:22,839
Keep distributing it to Sogut and Yenisehir.

281
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:24,559
Yes my Bey.

282
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:26,719
-Orhan.
-My Bey..

283
00:28:26,800 --> 00:28:30,199
You will come to Bursa with me.

284
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:36,359
Alaeddin. -My Bey...

285
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:39,959
You will stay here. You
will provide the security here.

286
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:46,159
But... you will protect my daughter-in-law.

287
00:28:47,520 --> 00:28:49,319
Yes, my Bey. -No...

288
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:52,399
...my daughter is entrusted to me, right?

289
00:28:52,520 --> 00:28:54,719
Thank you.

290
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:59,719
Gonca..

291
00:28:59,800 --> 00:29:02,719
Today, your father Yakup Bey and Mehmet...

292
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:06,239
...came to the marketplace.

293
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:09,839
You gave us the good news and made us happy.

294
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:13,439
If you wish, you can also give
the good news to your father.

295
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:19,199
I mean... What happened between
your father and us is different.

296
00:29:19,360 --> 00:29:21,599
So that he is going to have a grandchild...

297
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:26,759
...your father has to know, right?

298
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:30,559
Right, Bala? -Yes.

299
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:34,799
Besides, this might help you make peace, huh?

300
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:37,919
I don't know...

301
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:40,519
Do you think his heart softened?

302
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:48,239
As you wish. It's your choice.

303
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:54,759
Come on now. In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate

304
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:59,399
Thank you my Bey.

305
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:02,279
Here, my daughter.

306
00:30:36,040 --> 00:30:39,679
How are you, cousin Holofira?

307
00:30:40,120 --> 00:30:41,959
It's been years, right?

308
00:30:42,120 --> 00:30:47,239
So you remembered you had a cousin, Constantine.

309
00:30:47,360 --> 00:30:51,359
I thought you buried me alive here.

310
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:53,999
While you were in the dungeon..

311
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:57,599
...I conducted a detailed investigation about you.

312
00:30:57,800 --> 00:31:00,239
I had to find out...

313
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:03,039
...what happened between you...

314
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:06,639
...and the Kayis and Orhan especially.

315
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:11,159
I learned. Orhan...

316
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:14,319
...stole your heart first...

317
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:19,959
...then married a Bey's daughter.

318
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:24,919
He let you down just to get stronger.

319
00:31:25,080 --> 00:31:29,479
If you are happy now, allow
me to go to the monastery.

320
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:35,519
After completing your service to Byzantium,
you can start living in seclusion, Holofira.

321
00:31:36,040 --> 00:31:38,479
What do you want from me?

322
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:41,039
Osman Bey and his son Orhan..

323
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:44,999
...will come to Bursa as my guests.

324
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:49,559
But they will never return to their tribes.

325
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:53,639
Why should I care? They can all go to hell.

326
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:56,759
Amazing! Then..

327
00:31:57,120 --> 00:32:02,359
...you'll help me kill them when
they return from Bursa to their tribes.

328
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:12,919
Do you think killing your
guests here does not suit you?

329
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:15,479
It is politically wrong, of course.

330
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:18,399
But morally right, isn't it?

331
00:32:18,640 --> 00:32:21,639
Because they are Turks.

332
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:29,399
I will happily assist you.

333
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:33,359
This duty is holier than going to the monastery.

334
00:32:33,520 --> 00:32:36,519
Then go to the room I prepared for you.

335
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:39,399
Have master tailors sew beautiful clothes for you.

336
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:42,039
Choose the best one.

337
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:44,239
Get your hair done.

338
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:48,599
Look beautiful for Orhan, who still loves you.

339
00:32:50,760 --> 00:32:53,079
Hide your anger.

340
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:56,359
Do your duty.
-What am I going to do?

341
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:59,519
I'll tell you when the time comes.

342
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:05,319
Now... now I will ask something from you.

343
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:12,279
While my father was dying..

344
00:33:12,360 --> 00:33:14,599
..were you with him?

345
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:24,479
Yes, why did you ask?

346
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:29,919
I was wondering about his last words.

347
00:33:30,040 --> 00:33:32,719
There was never anyone that I could've asked.

348
00:33:32,800 --> 00:33:36,839
No matter how brave one is..

349
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:39,839
..they love living, Holofira.

350
00:33:40,120 --> 00:33:43,039
He begged to live as well.

351
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:45,999
However, he betrayed the Emperor.

352
00:33:46,080 --> 00:33:51,559
Just like every traitor, your
father was hanged to death.

353
00:33:51,840 --> 00:33:55,079
We tried really hard to not let him die.

354
00:33:55,120 --> 00:33:58,639
We wanted to have him exiled.
However, Emperor did not accept.

355
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:01,119
However, you, Holofira.

356
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:06,279
You will show your loyalty to The Emperor.

357
00:34:06,600 --> 00:34:09,719
You will lift that dark stain..

358
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:13,799
..on your family.

359
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:37,918
You despicable liar.

360
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:06,839
Elcim, are you alright?

361
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:11,439
I was distracted, sorry.

362
00:35:11,760 --> 00:35:14,319
I did not see you coming.

363
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:21,999
When Gonca Hatun gave the good news..

364
00:35:22,080 --> 00:35:24,319
..I remembered.

365
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:27,799
My father wanted to see his
grandchildren too, however..

366
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:30,719
However what, Hatun?

367
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:34,759
With Allah's permission,
we will have children too.

368
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:58,199
Don't you think I know you've
been sewing these in secrecy?

369
00:35:59,280 --> 00:36:01,919
My brother Alaeddin.

370
00:36:02,040 --> 00:36:05,479
It is like he just declared
his love to Gonca yesterday.

371
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:09,559
And now he will be a father.

372
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:12,199
In the same way..

373
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:17,919
..we will have children at times
we least expect it, if Allah permits.

374
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:22,719
Our children will grow up in this tribe together.

375
00:36:24,160 --> 00:36:28,159
They loved each other.

376
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:32,399
Their child is a fruit of their love.

377
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:37,919
Our child..

378
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:41,959
..will be the knot that ties two tribes together.

379
00:36:43,040 --> 00:36:46,479
A knot of a Grand State.

380
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:52,639
Of course, a knot of the Grand State.

381
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:57,639
The knot of Grand State that
will make many tyrants kneel.

382
00:36:57,800 --> 00:37:02,279
If Allah permits, our children will
see to many duties just as we do.

383
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:05,279
Only if Allah permits.

384
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:16,599
Holofira is at Bursa as well.

385
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:23,839
So what, Hatun?

386
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:29,039
We are heading to Bursa
for duty, don't you know that?

387
00:37:30,200 --> 00:37:32,919
Look at me.

388
00:37:35,520 --> 00:37:39,799
I've buried my love deep beneath the dirt.

389
00:37:40,040 --> 00:37:44,639
You know that best. We are
not heading to Bursa for Holofira..

390
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:49,079
..but to kill Konstantin, who
gave the order to kill your father.

391
00:37:49,160 --> 00:37:53,119
Elcim, we are going to Bursa..

392
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:56,839
..for you. To keep the promise I gave you..

393
00:37:56,920 --> 00:38:01,239
..and ease the pain in your heart.

394
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:08,279
Do not.

395
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:11,599
Do not ever..

396
00:38:11,720 --> 00:38:16,639
..question my loyalty. Do not ever.

397
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:10,319
Father! Father!

398
00:39:10,680 --> 00:39:14,119
Holofira! Holofira!

399
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:18,679
Holofira!

400
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:21,879
Holofira, don't cry for
your father! He is a traitor!

401
00:39:22,080 --> 00:39:25,759
You are a daughter of a noble
mother, now go back to her!

402
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:29,799
You will live as a noble princess in our kingdom!

403
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:33,599
Holofira. I am not a traitor.

404
00:39:34,040 --> 00:39:37,439
Do not forget that I've died
as an honorable commander.

405
00:39:37,680 --> 00:39:40,839
-Do not ever forget that.
-Father!

406
00:39:41,080 --> 00:39:46,239
Father! Father!
-Stop.

407
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:09,159
Murderers.

408
00:40:14,600 --> 00:40:17,239
Commander Konstantin.

409
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:21,639
I am at your service.

410
00:40:22,600 --> 00:40:25,959
I am giving you an important duty.

411
00:40:26,080 --> 00:40:29,319
Orhan and Holofira.

412
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:35,039
You know them well, right?

413
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:38,159
You are a witness to their love.

414
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:42,599
Now..

415
00:40:42,760 --> 00:40:48,119
..you will ensure that
Holofira is telling the truth.

416
00:41:18,080 --> 00:41:21,479
My gazelle-eyed.

417
00:41:22,040 --> 00:41:25,879
These whites on your hair..

418
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:28,119
And?

419
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:37,279
-What, Osman Bey? Are you saying I am old?
-No.

420
00:41:37,560 --> 00:41:41,719
However, our children grew up, being a father now.

421
00:41:41,800 --> 00:41:43,919
-And you..
-And you..

422
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:46,479
..are being a grandfather, Osman Bey.

423
00:41:46,680 --> 00:41:48,839
I am.

424
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:52,839
Thank Allah, for showing us these days.

425
00:41:53,080 --> 00:41:57,079
Thank Allah. I am already excited.

426
00:41:57,160 --> 00:42:01,039
Even if we get old, it is fine.

427
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:03,559
These whites on your hair..

428
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:07,679
..I love them the most.
Do you know why?

429
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:10,759
-Why?
-We got in love..

430
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:13,479
..became home, became family..

431
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:17,679
..these trees we have planted,
are now giving their fruits.

432
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:20,919
Those whites on your hair..

433
00:42:21,240 --> 00:42:24,439
..is a witness to that.

434
00:42:25,240 --> 00:42:31,439
And I remember the times we
spent together, after seeing them.

435
00:42:44,800 --> 00:42:46,959
My dear, what are you doing?

436
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:50,199
-Just making the bed.
-Hey, stop.

437
00:42:51,080 --> 00:42:54,719
From now on, it's my duty to tidy up.

438
00:42:54,960 --> 00:42:59,359
-It's just a light bedspread, Alaaddin.
-No, that's not the case.

439
00:43:04,800 --> 00:43:09,119
Now I'm counting the forbidden
things. Keep them in your mind.

440
00:43:09,280 --> 00:43:11,439
-Forbidden?
-Yes.

441
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:16,279
Well... From now on, no training.

442
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:19,039
-No riding.
-And?

443
00:43:19,040 --> 00:43:21,759
No carrying loads.

444
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:24,439
We live in a tribe, Alaaddin.

445
00:43:24,600 --> 00:43:28,097
What? Will I just stand
idle while there is work to do?

446
00:43:28,109 --> 00:43:29,279
Yes, you will.

447
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:35,879
You will smile at me just like this.

448
00:43:36,560 --> 00:43:39,279
And I will do the rest.

449
00:43:39,280 --> 00:43:42,199
Let's see what your mother will say.

450
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:45,679
My mother won't...

451
00:43:51,160 --> 00:43:54,719
...let her daughter-in-law
and the baby get exhausted.

452
00:43:55,120 --> 00:43:58,839
-I know. I know.
-Yes.

453
00:44:08,080 --> 00:44:11,959
Did you consider what my
father said last night, my dear?

454
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:16,919
I'm going to go to the
frontier market to collect taxes.

455
00:44:17,200 --> 00:44:19,479
Are you coming with me?

456
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:25,119
It's been a long time.

457
00:44:25,600 --> 00:44:29,439
Do you think my father's heart has softened?

458
00:44:31,880 --> 00:44:35,119
Even if it hasn't,

459
00:44:37,040 --> 00:44:41,079
...it will when he hears about the baby.

460
00:44:41,520 --> 00:44:44,439
I hope so.

461
00:44:45,200 --> 00:44:47,479
But this is my last visit.

462
00:44:47,680 --> 00:44:50,919
I will just do my duty as the daughter.

463
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:54,999
Alright. So be it. Come to me.

464
00:45:06,160 --> 00:45:09,799
Paleologus is holding the
leash of the jackal called Ulcay.

465
00:45:09,920 --> 00:45:12,759
This invitation must be a trick.

466
00:45:13,200 --> 00:45:15,359
But what trick?

467
00:45:15,480 --> 00:45:18,319
-I don't feel at ease, my Bey.
-Bala.

468
00:45:18,480 --> 00:45:22,439
...we'll ruin the tricks of the
one who is holding the leash...

469
00:45:22,880 --> 00:45:27,439
...just like we sent the
owner of the leash to hell

470
00:45:28,600 --> 00:45:32,599
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in.

471
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:38,319
We got a message from Turgay Alp, my Bey.

472
00:45:51,560 --> 00:45:53,799
Constantin...

473
00:45:54,240 --> 00:45:59,519
...slaughtered the people of
Bursa who objected to the war taxes.

474
00:46:01,760 --> 00:46:04,839
Turgay says the screams of
the innocent rise up to the sky.

475
00:46:04,960 --> 00:46:08,199
He has no mercy even for his own people, huh?

476
00:46:08,480 --> 00:46:11,799
Osman, the one who did this
to his kin and coreligionists...

477
00:46:11,880 --> 00:46:13,839
..must be a devil.

478
00:46:14,000 --> 00:46:17,959
May Allah let us face the honorable
enemies... Not like vile ones...

479
00:46:21,040 --> 00:46:25,239
I know, Bala. He can perform any kind of cruelty.

480
00:46:25,600 --> 00:46:27,959
But we have taken measures.

481
00:46:28,120 --> 00:46:31,439
Alps are disguised in Bursa.

482
00:46:31,760 --> 00:46:34,399
They're standing ready.

483
00:46:35,280 --> 00:46:39,599
We'll avenge Gunduz Bey and all the others.

484
00:46:40,320 --> 00:46:42,879
Yet..

485
00:46:43,360 --> 00:46:46,239
Constantin...

486
00:46:47,760 --> 00:46:50,919
The price he's going to pay...

487
00:46:51,120 --> 00:46:54,159
...will be pretty heavy.

488
00:47:08,200 --> 00:47:12,359
I'll give this letter to Orhan
through a servant girl.

489
00:47:13,040 --> 00:47:15,319
Orhan will come here.

490
00:47:15,560 --> 00:47:18,679
You two won’t be alone in the room.

491
00:47:19,080 --> 00:47:23,319
It's very kind of you to care
about me, Constantin. Thank you.

492
00:47:24,200 --> 00:47:26,599
What do you want me to do?

493
00:47:27,640 --> 00:47:30,879
To charm him with your beauty.

494
00:47:31,400 --> 00:47:34,479
To make him regret that he
married that Bey's daughter.

495
00:47:34,560 --> 00:47:37,479
That won't be hard.

496
00:47:37,880 --> 00:47:40,439
He still loves me.

497
00:47:42,080 --> 00:47:46,959
-What else?
-Find out their return route.

498
00:47:49,000 --> 00:47:51,999
I see the hatred in your heart.

499
00:47:52,360 --> 00:47:55,919
Your beautiful eyes miss nothing, my dear cousin.

500
00:47:56,200 --> 00:47:59,159
Now get prepared beautifully.

501
00:48:03,720 --> 00:48:09,159
Daughters shouldn't live their fathers' fates.

502
00:48:13,160 --> 00:48:18,399
Don't you betray me. Don't break my trust.

503
00:48:18,960 --> 00:48:22,399
Otherwise, both of you...

504
00:48:22,680 --> 00:48:26,239
..will pass away in this room.

505
00:48:37,160 --> 00:48:40,079
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

506
00:48:40,080 --> 00:48:43,159
-Welcome, my Shahzade.
-Welcome, Gonca Hatun.

507
00:49:01,040 --> 00:49:05,919
-Thank you, thank you.
-Welcome.

508
00:49:06,720 --> 00:49:09,199
Oh, Kayis!

509
00:49:09,560 --> 00:49:12,599
Welcome to our market.

510
00:49:13,240 --> 00:49:17,079
-Gonca Hatun.
-Don't raise troubles, Mehmed Bey.

511
00:49:23,880 --> 00:49:28,119
-Why are you here? To collect taxes?
-I heard...

512
00:49:28,280 --> 00:49:31,119
...you prepared the taxes. Thanks.

513
00:49:31,320 --> 00:49:34,239
But this isn't the only reason why we are here.

514
00:49:35,840 --> 00:49:38,199
Why are you here, Alaaddin?

515
00:49:38,480 --> 00:49:41,999
Is this your welcoming me after long time?

516
00:49:46,920 --> 00:49:51,399
We're here to see Yakup Bey. Get our of our way.

517
00:49:52,800 --> 00:49:55,839
My father has nothing to tell you.

518
00:49:56,880 --> 00:49:59,239
He doesn't want to see you.

519
00:49:59,440 --> 00:50:03,479
Move aside, Mehmed. If I want to see him, I see.

520
00:50:03,840 --> 00:50:06,199
Watch your words, Alaaddin.

521
00:50:06,960 --> 00:50:11,759
-Don't push me.
-My wife has things to say, Mehmed.

522
00:50:13,800 --> 00:50:18,359
You seem to have forgotten. Let me remind you.

523
00:50:19,000 --> 00:50:22,119
This frontier market is
mine. For your information.

524
00:50:22,600 --> 00:50:24,679
My Shahzade!

525
00:50:25,200 --> 00:50:28,199
My Bey wants to see them.

526
00:51:05,280 --> 00:51:09,079
Help. Help.

527
00:51:15,360 --> 00:51:16,399
Help.

528
00:51:16,400 --> 00:51:21,399
May God bless you.

529
00:51:28,560 --> 00:51:33,359
My children... My children...

530
00:51:35,880 --> 00:51:40,639
May God bless you.

531
00:51:42,680 --> 00:51:45,919
Keep your eyes wide open.

532
00:51:46,120 --> 00:51:49,199
If someone attempts to harm Osman Bey,

533
00:51:49,360 --> 00:51:52,919
...we will intervene immediately.

534
00:52:00,640 --> 00:52:04,759
Holy father, take me to heaven too.

535
00:52:04,960 --> 00:52:08,399
Please. I'm begging you.

536
00:52:09,280 --> 00:52:14,039
May Jesus Christ bless you,

537
00:52:14,320 --> 00:52:17,319
...my poor child.

538
00:52:19,360 --> 00:52:24,119
To go to heaven, first...

539
00:52:24,800 --> 00:52:27,279
..you should die.

540
00:52:31,680 --> 00:52:34,559
Estaghfir... Well..

541
00:52:37,520 --> 00:52:42,359
First look for God in the whole world...

542
00:52:42,720 --> 00:52:46,279
-Then you'll find heaven.
-How come?

543
00:52:47,080 --> 00:52:49,319
How?

544
00:52:50,440 --> 00:52:53,479
First start walking from here.

545
00:52:54,200 --> 00:52:57,759
I can't know everything.

546
00:53:01,680 --> 00:53:05,759
May God bless you.

547
00:54:29,600 --> 00:54:32,359
Nikola?

548
00:54:51,080 --> 00:54:56,279
Welcome to Bursa, the most
magnificent city of these lands, Osman Bey.

549
00:54:58,080 --> 00:55:02,079
Good. Rich.

550
00:55:03,600 --> 00:55:07,839
But not as mighty as it should be.

551
00:55:13,360 --> 00:55:16,239
Leave your horses here.

552
00:55:16,560 --> 00:55:20,439
You can't continue on horses.

553
00:55:21,200 --> 00:55:26,079
This is not a Turkish tribe
where you can ride your horses.

554
00:55:33,160 --> 00:55:38,639
Alright. For now, it's not.

555
00:55:44,400 --> 00:55:47,039
Look at me, commander.

556
00:55:47,440 --> 00:55:52,719
Treat our horses kindly.

557
00:55:53,920 --> 00:55:57,559
Make them feel at home.

558
00:55:59,040 --> 00:56:00,479
Well..

559
00:56:01,960 --> 00:56:06,839
If... If they are harmed,

560
00:56:07,080 --> 00:56:10,919
..I will make you pay for this.

561
00:56:31,200 --> 00:56:36,519
Don't be worrying, Osman Bey.
We will host your horses well!

562
00:56:36,880 --> 00:56:41,999
I know their language. If
you do something bad to them,

563
00:56:43,000 --> 00:56:45,559
I will know.

564
00:57:03,440 --> 00:57:09,239
Father, who is that stranger
beside Commander Aleksios?

565
00:57:11,560 --> 00:57:16,679
Osman Bey, Bey of Kayi.

566
00:57:19,800 --> 00:57:22,959
Osman Bey, huh?

567
00:57:31,760 --> 00:57:35,679
Have you come to see the market's condition?

568
00:57:36,560 --> 00:57:40,839
Or to collect taxes Alaaddin Bey?

569
00:57:41,480 --> 00:57:46,599
If you're asking about the market,
we are here for a duty, Yakup Bey.

570
00:57:47,440 --> 00:57:50,999
If you are asking why we wanted to see you,

571
00:57:51,680 --> 00:57:55,799
...we're here because we
respect you as my wife's father.

572
00:57:56,520 --> 00:57:59,359
Her father?

573
00:58:00,520 --> 00:58:02,799
Her father...

574
00:58:04,280 --> 00:58:06,959
Did you think...

575
00:58:07,480 --> 00:58:11,759
...I would forget what you made
me suffer when some time passed?

576
00:58:13,760 --> 00:58:18,079
No. I haven't forgotten.

577
00:58:20,400 --> 00:58:22,039
In Kutahya,

578
00:58:24,320 --> 00:58:28,239
...people still tell each other my
daughter ran away with my enemy.

579
00:58:30,200 --> 00:58:35,559
Don't tire me with your
words. Have a safe journey.

580
00:58:38,920 --> 00:58:43,919
I want to ask, father. I want to know.

581
00:58:46,080 --> 00:58:51,399
Don't you forgive me because people
gossip and your honor is damaged?

582
00:58:52,720 --> 00:58:55,559
Or don't you really want to forgive me?

583
00:58:55,960 --> 00:58:59,599
It doesn't matter anymore.

584
00:59:01,400 --> 00:59:05,479
Mehmed, deliver the taxes...

585
00:59:05,560 --> 00:59:08,399
...and see Kayi people off.

586
00:59:22,520 --> 00:59:23,559
#unrecognized text#

587
00:59:39,160 --> 00:59:43,159
You're going to have a grandchild, father.

588
00:59:47,880 --> 00:59:51,879
Does it matter to you?

589
01:00:11,920 --> 01:00:13,119
No.

590
01:00:15,240 --> 01:00:19,359
I don't have a daughter.
So I can't have a grandchild.

591
01:00:36,640 --> 01:00:38,679
Alright then.

592
01:00:43,440 --> 01:00:46,719
This was my last visit, father.

593
01:00:51,200 --> 01:00:55,319
I did my duty as the daughter.

594
01:01:07,400 --> 01:01:12,879
You rejected us twice before, Yakup Bey.

595
01:01:14,240 --> 01:01:17,359
We thought Muslims should try three times...

596
01:01:17,480 --> 01:01:19,839
...and came here again.

597
01:01:22,320 --> 01:01:28,279
But it's over now, Yakup Bey.

598
01:01:31,600 --> 01:01:34,599
Stay safe.

599
01:01:40,120 --> 01:01:43,079
Let's go, my dear.

600
01:01:48,600 --> 01:01:51,239
My Shahzade, the taxes are loaded.

601
01:01:51,320 --> 01:01:54,519
Fine. Let's go.

602
01:02:05,400 --> 01:02:06,799
Come on!

603
01:02:45,520 --> 01:02:49,479
Commander Konstantin will invite you to dinner.

604
01:02:49,800 --> 01:02:55,359
You can rest at your rooms until then.

605
01:03:14,880 --> 01:03:20,399
The letter came from Holofira,
my Bey. She wants to see me.

606
01:03:26,480 --> 01:03:33,079
Holofira was silent for so long.
Why is she writing a letter now?

607
01:03:33,800 --> 01:03:36,839
Konstantin.

608
01:03:36,920 --> 01:03:40,279
He must know about this as well.

609
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:46,359
My Shahzade, is this her writing?

610
01:03:46,560 --> 01:03:50,239
It is hers. However, there is one difference.

611
01:03:50,520 --> 01:03:55,279
Holofira wrote the letter
with his father's surname.

612
01:03:57,520 --> 01:03:59,559
Meaning, my Shahzade?

613
01:03:59,600 --> 01:04:03,679
As long as I knew Holofira, she always
wrote them with her aunt's surname.

614
01:04:03,720 --> 01:04:07,599
However, this time she wrote
it with his father's surname.

615
01:04:08,160 --> 01:04:11,319
They are making Holofira write letters by force.

616
01:04:11,440 --> 01:04:14,559
They are trying to pull her
into their tricks, however..

617
01:04:14,680 --> 01:04:19,079
-..she is giving us a sign.
-What will I do, my Bey?

618
01:04:20,560 --> 01:04:22,959
We will give them what they want.

619
01:04:23,160 --> 01:04:26,679
You will see Holofira.
However, you will be cautious.

620
01:04:27,000 --> 01:04:30,359
If Konstantin is behind this..

621
01:04:30,560 --> 01:04:34,919
..this can lead to them killing us even.

622
01:04:37,960 --> 01:04:43,279
They will watch and listen to you when you meet.

623
01:04:43,560 --> 01:04:48,319
-Do not show your intentions.
-As you command, my Bey.

624
01:04:53,760 --> 01:04:58,759
My Bey. What will they get from this in the end?

625
01:04:58,840 --> 01:05:03,839
We will find out about that from Holofira.
However, most probably, their intentions..

626
01:05:04,080 --> 01:05:08,719
..is to learn our route.

627
01:05:10,040 --> 01:05:13,679
They want to handle this without
soaking their hands in blood.

628
01:05:13,760 --> 01:05:16,839
Just as how they did to Gunduz Bey.

629
01:05:16,920 --> 01:05:23,039
Come on then. Let us see the face of the devil.

630
01:05:28,480 --> 01:05:31,479
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

631
01:05:31,760 --> 01:05:33,759
I've brought you gifts..

632
01:05:33,920 --> 01:05:37,759
..from the lands of Kar3si, Yakup Bey.

633
01:05:44,200 --> 01:05:47,879
You shouldn't have, Karesi Bey.

634
01:05:53,000 --> 01:05:55,559
-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

635
01:05:55,680 --> 01:05:57,879
Give these to those in need..

636
01:05:58,040 --> 01:06:02,359
-..around the tribe.
-As you command, my Bey.

637
01:06:04,120 --> 01:06:07,919
I thought you were at Kutahya.

638
01:06:08,040 --> 01:06:11,599
I was.

639
01:06:12,800 --> 01:06:18,719
However, after hearing
what is happening at frontiers..

640
01:06:20,080 --> 01:06:23,919
..I couldn't stay at Kutahya.

641
01:06:25,120 --> 01:06:27,919
You've made a deal with Osman.

642
01:06:28,200 --> 01:06:32,719
-Is that true, Karesi Bey?
-You've heard right.

643
01:06:33,480 --> 01:06:39,039
-How can you do this?
-Why is that a bad thing, Yakup Bey?

644
01:06:39,280 --> 01:06:42,719
Who should I support..

645
01:06:43,120 --> 01:06:45,199
..other than Osman Bey for war?

646
01:06:45,360 --> 01:06:49,239
There is a time for everything, Karesi Bey.

647
01:06:49,400 --> 01:06:53,959
The siege of Bursa and
Iznik is nothing but a dream.

648
01:06:54,120 --> 01:06:56,599
The ambitions of Osman..

649
01:06:56,680 --> 01:06:59,599
..will cause trouble..

650
01:06:59,680 --> 01:07:04,239
..to all people.
Can't you see that?

651
01:07:04,400 --> 01:07:08,999
If you know something, say it.

652
01:07:09,400 --> 01:07:14,399
Osman is preparing for Bursa and Iznik now.

653
01:07:14,560 --> 01:07:18,359
What about tomorrow? Constantinople.

654
01:07:18,440 --> 01:07:21,919
Maybe he will send only the soldiers.

655
01:07:23,720 --> 01:07:26,879
All of the people will break..

656
01:07:27,000 --> 01:07:31,199
..with a single mistake from Osman, Karesi Bey.

657
01:07:31,440 --> 01:07:35,399
Turn back while you still have the chance.

658
01:07:35,480 --> 01:07:39,399
Draw back the support you are giving to Osman.

659
01:07:40,240 --> 01:07:42,959
If he stays alone..

660
01:07:43,040 --> 01:07:46,839
-..he will also fall back.
-How will that happen, Yakup Bey?

661
01:07:47,400 --> 01:07:49,519
How can we leave Osman Bey..

662
01:07:49,720 --> 01:07:53,759
-..alone with those jackals?
-There is no need to fail..

663
01:07:53,960 --> 01:07:58,039
..alongside Osman, Karesi Bey.

664
01:07:58,560 --> 01:08:02,639
It is better for Osman to break..

665
01:08:02,800 --> 01:08:06,959
..instead of the people.

666
01:08:24,040 --> 01:08:27,759
Do not worry about treasures as well.

667
01:08:28,040 --> 01:08:30,639
I will personally give you..

668
01:08:30,760 --> 01:08:36,037
..the double what Osman promised you..

669
01:08:36,040 --> 01:08:38,398
..for war.

670
01:09:25,920 --> 01:09:29,839
Welcome, Osman Bey.

671
01:09:38,200 --> 01:09:43,278
Don't you have the courage to talk to me alone?

672
01:09:43,560 --> 01:09:47,398
Look at these guards behind you.

673
01:09:47,520 --> 01:09:53,158
I came to Bursa with four alps.

674
01:09:53,840 --> 01:09:56,799
Osman Bey is disturbed.

675
01:09:57,080 --> 01:10:00,399
All guards leave the room!

676
01:10:20,280 --> 01:10:23,399
I didn't know you
had to be on top..

677
01:10:23,640 --> 01:10:27,839
..to converse with me in the room.

678
01:10:29,400 --> 01:10:32,319
You outnumber me now.

679
01:10:39,240 --> 01:10:41,599
Here, Osman Bey.

680
01:11:41,320 --> 01:11:44,799
You wanted to meet us.

681
01:11:46,200 --> 01:11:49,879
Now you learned who we are.

682
01:11:51,680 --> 01:11:54,479
The things I've heard..

683
01:11:55,480 --> 01:11:58,519
..did not make me happy, Osman Bey.

684
01:11:58,760 --> 01:12:02,079
You are placing nomads..

685
01:12:02,160 --> 01:12:05,359
..on our trade routes on our fertile lands.

686
01:12:06,360 --> 01:12:11,239
One needs to be blind to not
see what you have been doing.

687
01:12:15,480 --> 01:12:18,839
My intention is true.

688
01:12:19,200 --> 01:12:22,199
Before my move..

689
01:12:22,280 --> 01:12:26,119
..everyone knew that.

690
01:12:26,280 --> 01:12:30,399
As long as I breathe..

691
01:12:30,720 --> 01:12:35,999
..there is no way for you
to siege Bursa, Osman Bey.

692
01:12:43,520 --> 01:12:47,039
I think so as well.

693
01:12:48,400 --> 01:12:51,679
Look at the World, Osman Bey.

694
01:12:51,800 --> 01:12:55,039
Every lion, every wolf who tried to siege Bursa..

695
01:12:55,720 --> 01:12:58,479
..has broken teeth now.

696
01:12:58,640 --> 01:13:03,799
Bursa is not a city you can reach.

697
01:13:03,880 --> 01:13:06,679
This city is not like..

698
01:13:06,920 --> 01:13:09,639
..those castles you took.

699
01:13:09,920 --> 01:13:16,199
Those who rule it, are not
like those Lords you defeated.

700
01:13:18,040 --> 01:13:22,359
You are in over your head.

701
01:13:25,800 --> 01:13:28,119
You will cut off all ties..

702
01:13:28,200 --> 01:13:31,919
..between Constantinople and Bursa.

703
01:13:32,000 --> 01:13:37,479
Then what? This city can feed itself for years.

704
01:13:37,800 --> 01:13:43,279
Don't tell me about Bursa. I know very well..

705
01:13:43,760 --> 01:13:46,559
..what kind of a city Bursa is.

706
01:13:47,920 --> 01:13:50,599
The things you just said..

707
01:13:50,760 --> 01:13:55,319
..can never deter me. On the contrary..

708
01:13:59,280 --> 01:14:05,159
..it feeds my ambition.

709
01:14:08,760 --> 01:14:15,199
That is why I want this city.

710
01:14:15,560 --> 01:14:19,119
That will never happen, Osman Bey.

711
01:14:23,440 --> 01:14:30,159
Either with the easy way, or the hard way.

712
01:14:30,760 --> 01:14:33,479
Sooner or later, Bursa..

713
01:14:33,800 --> 01:14:38,439
..will be the land of Turks.

714
01:14:43,040 --> 01:14:47,279
You won't last long enough for that, Osman Bey.

715
01:14:47,560 --> 01:14:51,999
Only Allah knows that. However..

716
01:14:52,120 --> 01:14:58,639
..I will do whatever I
can, so that you won't last.

717
01:15:01,640 --> 01:15:03,159
Now, tell me.

718
01:15:04,680 --> 01:15:08,959
What do you want to speak with me?

719
01:15:23,080 --> 01:15:24,919
Holofira.

720
01:15:45,520 --> 01:15:48,559
You called me?

721
01:15:49,320 --> 01:15:55,879
I did, and you came, as if
you've been waiting for this day.

722
01:16:04,960 --> 01:16:10,519
Are you alright? Why did you call me?

723
01:16:20,160 --> 01:16:26,199
The same reason why you came despite Elcim.

724
01:16:26,480 --> 01:16:30,319
You could've not come as well.

725
01:16:33,200 --> 01:16:41,079
You are right. I shouldn't have come.

726
01:16:44,120 --> 01:16:49,599
Go! Like you always do! Run away!

727
01:16:53,600 --> 01:16:56,039
Holofira.

728
01:16:57,440 --> 01:17:02,479
Are you alright? Did something happen?

729
01:17:05,880 --> 01:17:09,079
You still love me.

730
01:17:17,160 --> 01:17:20,159
Don't, Holofira.

731
01:17:20,680 --> 01:17:24,799
Do not throw the ashes of this love.

732
01:17:26,040 --> 01:17:32,479
Ashes? Has the fire of this love ever gone out?

733
01:17:39,320 --> 01:17:45,239
After everything that happened,
why does that matter, huh?

734
01:17:48,280 --> 01:17:51,199
Have you been able to forget me?

735
01:17:52,800 --> 01:17:55,719
Was this really your love?

736
01:17:59,520 --> 01:18:02,639
Holofira..

737
01:18:05,000 --> 01:18:08,759
I accepted this marriage for my family...

738
01:18:09,280 --> 01:18:12,559
...for my tribe. And you know that.

739
01:18:12,800 --> 01:18:15,559
Yes. I do.

740
01:18:15,920 --> 01:18:19,079
You chose your family, Orhan.

741
01:18:19,240 --> 01:18:23,399
You left me all alone.

742
01:18:23,600 --> 01:18:28,119
But you didn't only betray
me, you also betrayed yourself!

743
01:18:28,600 --> 01:18:32,839
You gave up on your love and married Elcim!

744
01:18:32,960 --> 01:18:36,199
I had no other choice!

745
01:18:36,360 --> 01:18:41,639
But you... you had one, Holofira. What did you do?

746
01:18:42,040 --> 01:18:46,599
You... chose to leave!

747
01:18:47,040 --> 01:18:52,679
Now... What changed, Holofira?

748
01:18:55,240 --> 01:18:59,679
I've been in pain since I came here.

749
01:18:59,920 --> 01:19:02,999
No matter how angry I am..

750
01:19:03,120 --> 01:19:06,039
...I've realized that my love for you...

751
01:19:06,680 --> 01:19:09,199
..will never end.

752
01:19:11,160 --> 01:19:16,479
Holofira... -Why?

753
01:19:18,160 --> 01:19:24,679
How could you betray us while
we loved each other like this?

754
01:19:33,400 --> 01:19:37,719
I will offer you the opportunity
to continue your existence.

755
01:19:38,640 --> 01:19:45,399
Otherwise, you and your people
will march towards your end.

756
01:19:47,640 --> 01:19:53,119
Tell me.
-You will open all the roads you blocked.

757
01:19:53,200 --> 01:19:56,719
We will make you a partner in our trade.

758
01:19:56,840 --> 01:20:03,119
All goods and roads from
Constantinople to Bursa...

759
01:20:03,120 --> 01:20:05,919
...will be under our dominion.

760
01:20:06,360 --> 01:20:09,239
After Bursa, we will leave...

761
01:20:09,400 --> 01:20:12,159
...all the trade of the East to you.

762
01:20:16,240 --> 01:20:19,679
Has no one ever told you that..

763
01:20:21,880 --> 01:20:25,479
...I will not sell gaza for gold?

764
01:20:25,760 --> 01:20:28,599
You don't want gaza..

765
01:20:29,080 --> 01:20:31,319
...you just want to be the best.

766
01:20:31,600 --> 01:20:34,319
I am giving you that.

767
01:20:36,080 --> 01:20:40,319
Be sure you make the right choice.

768
01:20:41,760 --> 01:20:43,759
You have suppressed all the Beys.

769
01:20:43,960 --> 01:20:47,399
You crushed them and have risen.

770
01:20:47,680 --> 01:20:50,199
Even in Constantinople...

771
01:20:50,280 --> 01:20:54,639
...your name is mentioned
as the protector of the Turks.

772
01:20:54,880 --> 01:20:59,399
You cannot protect it this way, Osman Bey.

773
01:21:04,320 --> 01:21:07,999
I am not seeking any way...

774
01:21:08,080 --> 01:21:10,879
...to protect my sultanate.

775
01:21:11,000 --> 01:21:16,559
My path is known. It is the
path of gaza ordered by my Allah.

776
01:21:16,640 --> 01:21:22,439
That path can bring your end, Osman Bey.

777
01:21:25,160 --> 01:21:30,519
I thought we could come to an agreement.

778
01:21:41,920 --> 01:21:44,559
Actually...

779
01:21:47,440 --> 01:21:50,999
..there is one more way.

780
01:21:52,680 --> 01:21:56,919
I would like to hear that. -I will break...

781
01:21:57,200 --> 01:22:00,279
...all your relations with Byzantium.

782
01:22:01,520 --> 01:22:04,439
Your trade will be weak.

783
01:22:04,520 --> 01:22:07,439
It will come to an end after a while.

784
01:22:11,600 --> 01:22:15,199
...if you do not wish to fight against me...

785
01:22:16,520 --> 01:22:21,039
...then you will bring..

786
01:22:21,640 --> 01:22:27,159
...five hundred thousand gold
coins to my tent every year.

787
01:22:30,680 --> 01:22:35,119
If we opened your treasury today, Osman Bey...

788
01:22:35,520 --> 01:22:38,399
...would you have this much gold?

789
01:22:39,800 --> 01:22:43,719
You are the one who wants to make peace with me.

790
01:22:44,040 --> 01:22:48,639
You will make this decision.

791
01:23:03,640 --> 01:23:09,279
Lord is not in Bursa right now.

792
01:23:09,480 --> 01:23:14,519
When he comes, I will talk to him about this.

793
01:23:15,320 --> 01:23:19,559
And I will inform the Emperor
about this with a letter.

794
01:23:19,760 --> 01:23:22,439
You would have wanted it so much, wouldn't you?

795
01:23:22,560 --> 01:23:25,559
What? -Me to...

796
01:23:26,760 --> 01:23:31,959
..pass away to the afterlife like Gunduz
Bey. You would want that so much.

797
01:23:36,280 --> 01:23:39,839
You have my brother's blood on your hands.

798
01:23:40,680 --> 01:23:44,799
You are trying to agree
with me by offering me gold.

799
01:23:44,920 --> 01:23:51,279
From now on, I will never accept any peace...

800
01:23:51,360 --> 01:23:56,559
..that you are a part of.
-You started the war...

801
01:23:56,720 --> 01:24:02,039
...you cannot hold me responsible
for the price you paid, Osman Bey.

802
01:24:02,240 --> 01:24:06,559
If you do not stop this war...

803
01:24:07,280 --> 01:24:10,079
...Gunduz Bey...

804
01:24:10,440 --> 01:24:14,759
...will not be the last one to die.

805
01:24:18,400 --> 01:24:21,719
We are not afraid of death.

806
01:24:22,960 --> 01:24:26,399
If we were..

807
01:24:26,480 --> 01:24:30,559
...we wouldn't have come to Bursa.

808
01:24:32,080 --> 01:24:35,719
This will be a long war.

809
01:24:36,000 --> 01:24:40,519
But only I will decide...

810
01:24:45,880 --> 01:24:49,479
..who will die and who will survive.

811
01:25:02,360 --> 01:25:07,319
Constantine...

812
01:25:23,800 --> 01:25:27,199
Speak! Why don't you speak, Orhan?!

813
01:25:27,400 --> 01:25:31,319
Tell me something! How could you betray us?

814
01:25:40,280 --> 01:25:42,479
Holofira...

815
01:25:46,840 --> 01:25:50,439
What are you doing, huh?

816
01:25:52,960 --> 01:25:57,719
Are you going to kill me with your love...

817
01:25:58,640 --> 01:26:02,119
...or are you going to have Constantine kill me?

818
01:26:04,640 --> 01:26:09,279
I don't need anyone to kill you!

819
01:26:09,480 --> 01:26:13,599
I can kill you with my own hands!

820
01:26:23,880 --> 01:26:29,959
But I still love you.

821
01:26:41,320 --> 01:26:43,559
You..

822
01:26:44,920 --> 01:26:49,599
What is this game that you
are playing with me, Holofira?

823
01:26:51,160 --> 01:26:54,919
You still think it is a game.

824
01:26:56,960 --> 01:27:02,199
You never believed my love.

825
01:27:03,160 --> 01:27:05,479
You never loved me.

826
01:27:08,000 --> 01:27:13,399
Damn the day I met you.

827
01:27:15,800 --> 01:27:20,559
You are telling the truth. It's not a game, huh?

828
01:27:21,640 --> 01:27:26,919
A game? If my cousin Constantine...

829
01:27:27,520 --> 01:27:33,759
...finds out about us, he
will kill us. But I don't care.

830
01:27:34,840 --> 01:27:37,319
Constantine..

831
01:27:38,800 --> 01:27:41,559
So Constantine is your cousin.

832
01:27:42,000 --> 01:27:45,479
Take me away from here.
Let's not worry about the future.

833
01:27:46,760 --> 01:27:50,959
you still want me..

834
01:27:51,240 --> 01:27:55,679
...make your decision now, Orhan.

835
01:28:02,640 --> 01:28:06,799
No one in this world can
love you more than I do...

836
01:28:08,280 --> 01:28:13,799
...and me more than you, Lord's daughter.

837
01:28:14,680 --> 01:28:17,079
Then... -Then we'll leave.

838
01:28:17,280 --> 01:28:20,839
We'll leave right away, now.

839
01:28:23,480 --> 01:28:26,279
Constantine is a devil.

840
01:28:26,640 --> 01:28:29,999
He's the one who arrested
my father and took him to death.

841
01:28:30,000 --> 01:28:34,079
I don't want to stay here anymore.

842
01:28:34,280 --> 01:28:38,839
We'll go, my Holofira. We'll go.

843
01:28:39,000 --> 01:28:45,559
But... but how will we go?

844
01:28:46,800 --> 01:28:50,479
I will set out to go to the monastery!

845
01:28:50,920 --> 01:28:54,839
I will change my route there and join you.

846
01:28:55,080 --> 01:29:00,679
You thought well... We
will pass by the Tribe Kesis.

847
01:29:02,440 --> 01:29:05,519
I will wait for you there, Lord's daughter.

848
01:29:06,000 --> 01:29:08,559
But I have to go now.

849
01:29:31,240 --> 01:29:37,639
Your and the Kayis' end is very close, Orhan.

850
01:29:37,880 --> 01:29:43,799
I will make you pay for the pain you caused me.

851
01:29:46,880 --> 01:29:49,879
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

852
01:30:03,000 --> 01:30:07,799
Praise be to you, Yakup Bey. May
your happiness be everlasting.

853
01:30:08,040 --> 01:30:11,519
You seem like you defeated your biggest enemy.

854
01:30:12,080 --> 01:30:15,359
If Allah permits, that day will come.

855
01:30:16,080 --> 01:30:21,399
We will pierce through the
chests of the infidels in this world.

856
01:30:24,480 --> 01:30:28,959
There is no need to go that far.

857
01:30:29,040 --> 01:30:31,879
What did our Rasulullah (PBUH) Efendi say?

858
01:30:32,000 --> 01:30:34,319
Your biggest enemy...

859
01:30:34,640 --> 01:30:37,959
...is your nafs between your eyebrows.

860
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:43,999
Sure... sure.

861
01:30:44,440 --> 01:30:48,319
We are all struggling with our nafs.

862
01:30:48,600 --> 01:30:51,719
It's such an enemy that...

863
01:30:52,040 --> 01:30:56,439
...it demands taxes from those
who he calls his "religious brothers".

864
01:30:56,600 --> 01:30:59,919
It sets his eyes on what's his.

865
01:31:00,040 --> 01:31:04,159
There are such people. You know that. -I do.

866
01:31:04,240 --> 01:31:06,159
I do.

867
01:31:06,560 --> 01:31:09,799
And I know people who
hold a grudge against their...

868
01:31:09,880 --> 01:31:13,519
...family just because they
are worried about rumours.

869
01:31:13,880 --> 01:31:17,799
I know people who disown their children.

870
01:31:22,680 --> 01:31:28,679
After a daughter disobeys her own father...

871
01:31:29,560 --> 01:31:33,959
When words come out from
the nafs and not from the heart...

872
01:31:34,040 --> 01:31:37,119
..it also burns its owner.

873
01:31:37,280 --> 01:31:42,319
I can see it. It does not seem alright.

874
01:31:46,880 --> 01:31:49,719
Let alone fighting with your nafs...

875
01:31:50,000 --> 01:31:53,279
...even being unaware of its enmity...

876
01:31:53,560 --> 01:31:58,359
...destroys a person. It leaves him alone.

877
01:31:58,680 --> 01:32:00,719
He cannot even see the difference...

878
01:32:00,920 --> 01:32:05,679
...between honor and disgrace, Haqq and falsehood.

879
01:32:05,760 --> 01:32:08,439
As you talk to me...

880
01:32:08,640 --> 01:32:14,439
...I see those who took what was
mine and those who disobeyed me.

881
01:32:16,480 --> 01:32:20,919
Yet your words are precious to me.

882
01:32:21,320 --> 01:32:23,959
And the cure of my heart.

883
01:32:25,200 --> 01:32:28,599
Don't deprive me from this.

884
01:32:30,080 --> 01:32:34,319
The one who wants the truth doesn't need words.

885
01:32:35,360 --> 01:32:38,119
An ant's footsteps would be enough.

886
01:32:38,480 --> 01:32:41,639
But for the one who wants power for his ambitions,

887
01:32:41,800 --> 01:32:46,999
...even the town cries screaming
about truths with drums...

888
01:32:47,240 --> 01:32:48,879
...would have no impacts.

889
01:32:49,880 --> 01:32:52,719
Both my heart and my mind..

890
01:32:52,960 --> 01:32:55,879
...are in the same line, thanks to Allah.

891
01:32:57,080 --> 01:33:02,479
I'm looking forward to
hearing the ant's footsteps.

892
01:33:04,160 --> 01:33:08,079
-Stay safe.
-Stay safe.

893
01:34:36,560 --> 01:34:40,719
-Father! Father!
-Is he alright? My Bey!

894
01:34:43,120 --> 01:34:45,799
Kanyumaz!

895
01:34:46,600 --> 01:34:51,199
-Father! Father!
-Get him up.

896
01:34:53,880 --> 01:34:57,679
-Come on.
-My Bey.

897
01:35:00,360 --> 01:35:01,959
Father.

898
01:35:58,920 --> 01:36:01,159
They have nothing to do with the market.

899
01:36:01,400 --> 01:36:05,919
They watch the corners.
There must be something up.

900
01:36:09,800 --> 01:36:12,199
They also have weapons. Who are they?

901
01:36:12,280 --> 01:36:15,319
Dogs disguised as people.

902
01:36:15,480 --> 01:36:18,039
People go home and these come out.

903
01:36:18,120 --> 01:36:22,639
They'll attack and put the blame on market people.

904
01:36:40,040 --> 01:36:42,919
You did a good job, Holofira.

905
01:36:45,400 --> 01:36:48,599
I always take what I want, Constantin.

906
01:36:49,680 --> 01:36:53,319
I made Orhan tell me about their return route.

907
01:36:56,560 --> 01:37:00,839
After leaving Bursa, they'll go to Monk Plains.

908
01:37:01,480 --> 01:37:04,919
Then they'll reach the tribe. This is their route.

909
01:37:05,520 --> 01:37:08,719
I'm grateful to you.

910
01:37:10,360 --> 01:37:12,719
But..

911
01:37:13,960 --> 01:37:18,879
I have no intention to kill them on the way back.

912
01:37:19,920 --> 01:37:24,439
I just wanted to be sure about your honesty.

913
01:37:29,000 --> 01:37:33,119
If you are sure, then that
means I can go to Monastir.

914
01:37:33,280 --> 01:37:39,999
Of course. But wait a for a while.
Because things will get crazy in Bursa.

915
01:37:41,040 --> 01:37:44,959
I'll kill them before they leave the city.

916
01:37:45,920 --> 01:37:48,359
If anyone survives,

917
01:37:48,440 --> 01:37:52,319
...I will slaughter them in the Monk Valley.

918
01:38:34,080 --> 01:38:36,679
They're taking Osman Bey's horses.

919
01:38:36,720 --> 01:38:38,119
We'll leave..

920
01:38:38,200 --> 01:38:41,919
...neither Osman Bey nor
our horses to these dastards.

921
01:38:42,160 --> 01:38:45,679
Alright, Solgur Agha. Come on.

922
01:38:46,800 --> 01:38:49,719
Come on.

923
01:38:52,520 --> 01:38:57,359
You turned out to be right, my Bey.
They'll attack us on the way back.

924
01:38:58,040 --> 01:39:01,679
-You think they took the bait?
-They did, my Bey.

925
01:39:01,800 --> 01:39:04,559
They heard everything Holofira and I talked about.

926
01:39:04,680 --> 01:39:06,919
They think we'll go back through Monk Valley.

927
01:39:07,120 --> 01:39:10,799
Good. When they attack, we'll avenge Gunduz Bey.

928
01:39:10,880 --> 01:39:13,159
Alright, my Bey.

929
01:39:13,400 --> 01:39:15,359
My Bey...

930
01:39:16,720 --> 01:39:21,199
What about Holofira? Will
we leave her to that dog?

931
01:39:21,400 --> 01:39:23,679
What if he attempts to kill her?

932
01:39:23,800 --> 01:39:26,679
Holofira must have won Constantin's favor.

933
01:39:27,120 --> 01:39:31,639
Don't be worrying. Her
life will be safer than ours.

934
01:39:51,360 --> 01:39:55,119
The Righteous!

935
01:40:11,680 --> 01:40:15,879
Fatma Hatun! Tall Shahzade
and Gonca Hatun are coming.

936
01:40:16,360 --> 01:40:20,039
You go to the training zone. I'll come after you.

937
01:40:37,320 --> 01:40:40,959
-Come, my dear.
-In the name of Allah.

938
01:40:41,080 --> 01:40:45,199
Did Yakup Bey forgive you, Gonca Hatun?

939
01:40:53,280 --> 01:40:57,039
My sister...

940
01:40:57,760 --> 01:41:01,719
Don't be upset. We'll always be with you.

941
01:41:01,840 --> 01:41:04,959
I know, Fatma. I know.

942
01:41:06,720 --> 01:41:08,639
Don't be sad, Gonca Hatun.

943
01:41:08,680 --> 01:41:11,559
It doesn't matter even if
Mehmed Bey doesn't forgive.

944
01:41:11,600 --> 01:41:15,119
I will be my nephew's uncle!

945
01:41:19,120 --> 01:41:22,359
Thank you, his uncle Ghazi.

946
01:41:30,160 --> 01:41:32,999
I'll go check the rug house.

947
01:41:37,960 --> 01:41:40,839
Praise be to my boy.

948
01:41:41,120 --> 01:41:43,879
Ghazi, you are a big man.

949
01:41:45,120 --> 01:41:48,279
I know. I know, my Shahzade.

950
01:41:48,800 --> 01:41:51,079
Don't mind my height.

951
01:41:51,200 --> 01:41:54,839
I have even more under the surface.

952
01:41:57,400 --> 01:42:00,319
Good boy.

953
01:42:01,840 --> 01:42:04,919
-Son!
-Mother.

954
01:42:05,400 --> 01:42:07,319
Good news?

955
01:42:10,120 --> 01:42:13,319
Yakup Bey's heart isn't warming up, mother.

956
01:42:14,000 --> 01:42:17,799
I know... His ice will never melt.

957
01:42:18,520 --> 01:42:24,319
Yakup Bey isn't harming his
pride but he's hurting his daughter.

958
01:42:25,200 --> 01:42:27,319
She doesn't want me to see..

959
01:42:27,720 --> 01:42:30,799
...but this bothers Gonca too much, mother.

960
01:42:32,520 --> 01:42:35,759
I don't know what to do.

961
01:42:36,640 --> 01:42:40,639
I know, son. You need to be with her.

962
01:42:40,720 --> 01:42:43,439
We'll always be with her.

963
01:42:43,880 --> 01:42:47,519
Yes, we will.

964
01:42:48,240 --> 01:42:50,439
Let's go.

965
01:42:59,240 --> 01:43:04,759
The growing horses of
Turks are the blood of Turks!

966
01:43:04,800 --> 01:43:07,519
Hands trying to touch them shall be broken!

967
01:43:07,640 --> 01:43:10,079
Eyes set on them shall be scratched out!

968
01:43:17,560 --> 01:43:20,679
Ya Allah!

969
01:43:24,040 --> 01:43:27,159
You heathens! Solgur Agha!

970
01:43:31,320 --> 01:43:34,199
They'll notice their absence shortly.

971
01:43:34,360 --> 01:43:37,519
Let's take the horses out of the city quickly.

972
01:43:37,520 --> 01:43:39,319
Let's go.

973
01:43:59,040 --> 01:44:01,639
There is something up here.

974
01:44:01,960 --> 01:44:05,639
This must be Constantin's doing.

975
01:44:19,200 --> 01:44:23,039
They are not ordinary people, my Bey.

976
01:44:27,200 --> 01:44:30,279
They intend to attack us, my Bey.

977
01:44:31,840 --> 01:44:33,999
We know what they'll do.

978
01:44:34,320 --> 01:44:36,679
But what will we do?

979
01:44:40,960 --> 01:44:45,079
We don't want infidel Turks in our city!

980
01:44:45,120 --> 01:44:46,399
We do not!

981
01:44:46,400 --> 01:44:50,239
They're not ordinary people but armed
assassins, my Bey. They'll attack us.

982
01:44:50,240 --> 01:44:53,759
It seems they laid the trap
outside, not inside the palace.

983
01:44:53,880 --> 01:44:57,879
-Where are the horses?
-They're safe. We don't want!

984
01:44:57,960 --> 01:45:01,279
-Don't be exposed. -Barbarian Turk!

985
01:45:03,040 --> 01:45:06,839
-Brothers, you see for yourselves.
-Alps.

986
01:45:07,320 --> 01:45:10,759
Retreat while they draw their swords.
-Brothers!

987
01:45:10,840 --> 01:45:15,439
Brothers, every step those
betrayers take in our lands...

988
01:45:15,600 --> 01:45:19,359
...is making Jesus turn in his grave!

989
01:45:30,880 --> 01:45:34,159
Destroy those things! Block the ways!

990
01:45:36,880 --> 01:45:40,399
Then we will destroy all of you!

991
01:46:15,600 --> 01:46:19,679
Now we are going back! We will come back stronger.

992
01:46:21,720 --> 01:46:25,999
Come on, brother!

993
01:47:05,360 --> 01:47:11,159
You are still crying for your father
but there is no reason, Gonca.

994
01:47:13,360 --> 01:47:17,359
What is going to change if they forgive you now?

995
01:47:18,640 --> 01:47:22,199
Your family is treacherous.

996
01:47:26,400 --> 01:47:29,759
This enmity will not end.

997
01:47:29,880 --> 01:47:33,239
Control your tongue, Elcim.
-Am I lying?

998
01:47:34,120 --> 01:47:38,159
You're being upset for nothing. Tell me.

999
01:47:38,440 --> 01:47:40,679
Why are you not organizing your wedding?

1000
01:47:40,840 --> 01:47:43,599
It's been a long time since you got married.

1001
01:47:43,840 --> 01:47:48,639
You kept postponing it.

1002
01:47:50,560 --> 01:47:54,039
Bey, right? -Elcim!

1003
01:47:54,360 --> 01:47:57,839
No... You deserve it.

1004
01:47:58,200 --> 01:48:01,839
You want to kiss your father's
hand and organize your wedding.

1005
01:48:01,960 --> 01:48:05,519
But that's just a dream. Your father...

1006
01:48:05,680 --> 01:48:08,919
...is the enemy of Kayis.

1007
01:48:11,800 --> 01:48:14,639
Yakup Bey will not make peace with Kayis but...

1008
01:48:14,920 --> 01:48:18,759
...he might forgive you.

1009
01:48:18,840 --> 01:48:21,639
You are trying to say something else! I know that!

1010
01:48:21,640 --> 01:48:24,679
You want your husband and
your father to make peace, but...

1011
01:48:24,680 --> 01:48:27,159
But what, Elcim?

1012
01:48:32,440 --> 01:48:36,199
Why does it bother you that a daughter wants to...

1013
01:48:36,480 --> 01:48:40,319
...make peace with her father, my daughter?

1014
01:48:43,920 --> 01:48:47,239
Control yourself.
-I can control myself.

1015
01:48:47,720 --> 01:48:50,919
My father died for Osman Bey.

1016
01:48:51,440 --> 01:48:53,719
What did they do?

1017
01:48:53,880 --> 01:48:59,919
They've been making plans
behind your back since day one.

1018
01:49:16,600 --> 01:49:19,159
So there is no way out, huh?

1019
01:49:20,440 --> 01:49:23,679
We’ve arrived, my Bey!

1020
01:49:44,160 --> 01:49:45,119
Here.

1021
01:49:46,400 --> 01:49:49,759
Have you missed fighting side by side with me?

1022
01:49:49,800 --> 01:49:53,879
I have, but I wish this was not the first time!

1023
01:49:58,880 --> 01:50:02,479
Block all the streets, hold
the entrances and exits!

1024
01:50:02,600 --> 01:50:05,519
Find them!

1025
01:50:09,440 --> 01:50:13,399
There was no way that they could escape.

1026
01:50:13,520 --> 01:50:18,719
Apparently Osman took his
precaution before he came here.

1027
01:50:19,240 --> 01:50:23,559
But he won't be able to run away from me.

1028
01:50:29,040 --> 01:50:32,599
They are coming from this side, my Bey!

1029
01:50:34,840 --> 01:50:38,119
We are trapped here!

1030
01:50:38,240 --> 01:50:41,039
Then we will fight. Or...

1031
01:50:41,160 --> 01:50:44,919
...my Allah will show us a way out.

1032
01:50:47,240 --> 01:50:49,519
Osman Bey!

1033
01:50:51,680 --> 01:50:55,319
This way.

1034
01:51:04,080 --> 01:51:11,159
-Catch them!
-Let us find them!

1035
01:51:46,520 --> 01:51:50,959
-Bala Hatun.
-My girl.

1036
01:51:58,320 --> 01:52:02,799
Come on, sit.

1037
01:52:05,800 --> 01:52:08,999
Look at me.

1038
01:52:09,920 --> 01:52:15,159
What are you carrying in your
heart that spills out of your mouth?

1039
01:52:15,280 --> 01:52:17,039
I know you.

1040
01:52:17,160 --> 01:52:21,199
You are not a Hatun that
normally says these things.

1041
01:52:21,360 --> 01:52:24,879
I have no one left, Bala Hatun.

1042
01:52:25,200 --> 01:52:30,039
My family, my father. They all died.

1043
01:52:31,720 --> 01:52:33,959
I have no one to talk.

1044
01:52:34,160 --> 01:52:36,799
Look what you are saying.

1045
01:52:37,240 --> 01:52:39,359
We are here, my daughter.

1046
01:52:39,800 --> 01:52:45,079
Orhan, Fatma, Gonca is here.

1047
01:52:45,320 --> 01:52:48,879
I am here.

1048
01:52:49,480 --> 01:52:52,119
Does Orhan not act like your husband?

1049
01:52:52,200 --> 01:52:55,639
He does. Of course he does.

1050
01:52:55,840 --> 01:52:58,799
He is good, merciful.

1051
01:52:59,480 --> 01:53:03,199
What can a Hatun want more?

1052
01:53:03,320 --> 01:53:06,519
However, I don't know.

1053
01:53:06,840 --> 01:53:11,999
When looking at Gonca and Alaeddin Bey..

1054
01:53:17,720 --> 01:53:19,559
Look, my daughter.

1055
01:53:20,080 --> 01:53:22,239
"Everyone is different"

1056
01:53:22,480 --> 01:53:26,239
Say our ancestors.

1057
01:53:26,680 --> 01:53:31,599
Just as how people are different,
they also face different challenges.

1058
01:53:32,480 --> 01:53:34,999
You are not alone, my girl.

1059
01:53:35,080 --> 01:53:40,079
You are only pushing yourself to loneliness.

1060
01:53:40,920 --> 01:53:43,879
If you get out of this tent and called for help..

1061
01:53:44,000 --> 01:53:47,039
..everyone would come to you.

1062
01:53:47,200 --> 01:53:50,319
We are a family.

1063
01:53:51,480 --> 01:53:53,959
Also..

1064
01:53:54,280 --> 01:53:59,439
..those who do not talk about
their problems can't find a solution.

1065
01:54:01,640 --> 01:54:04,159
Look here.

1066
01:54:04,600 --> 01:54:08,879
You ruined your craft too.

1067
01:54:16,320 --> 01:54:19,399
Look here.

1068
01:54:19,640 --> 01:54:23,959
You are not scared of having no children, right?

1069
01:54:24,360 --> 01:54:27,119
My girl, don't you ever.

1070
01:54:27,360 --> 01:54:31,719
You are just married. Don't lose hope.

1071
01:54:31,880 --> 01:54:34,759
You will pray, right?

1072
01:54:40,560 --> 01:54:44,479
What is this? Come on.

1073
01:54:51,480 --> 01:54:55,479
Get out of the way! Alaeddin!

1074
01:54:55,760 --> 01:54:57,639
Alaeddin

1075
01:54:58,600 --> 01:54:59,679
What is this.

1076
01:55:00,080 --> 01:55:03,399
What is Mehmet doing here?
-Brother!

1077
01:55:05,240 --> 01:55:07,999
Move! Move! -Father!

1078
01:55:08,080 --> 01:55:10,497
Father! What happened?
What happened to my father?

1079
01:55:10,509 --> 01:55:11,319
I don't know!

1080
01:55:11,480 --> 01:55:13,719
Yakup Bey is there!

1081
01:55:13,800 --> 01:55:15,559
What is happening? -Move!

1082
01:55:15,600 --> 01:55:17,799
-What happened?
-Alaeddin help! -Wait, Hatun.

1083
01:55:17,880 --> 01:55:20,319
Help, Alaeddin. -Gonca, stop.

1084
01:55:20,400 --> 01:55:21,759
Yakup Bey!

1085
01:55:21,920 --> 01:55:23,879
Yakup Bey, do you hear me? Yakup Bey!

1086
01:55:24,000 --> 01:55:26,119
Alaeddin, help!

1087
01:55:26,200 --> 01:55:28,639
Yakup Bey! Yakup Bey! -Father!

1088
01:55:29,960 --> 01:55:32,799
Father... what happened to him?

1089
01:55:32,880 --> 01:55:35,679
Father!
-Let's take him to the healing tent! Hurry!

1090
01:55:35,760 --> 01:55:38,159
Come on! Hurry!

1091
01:55:38,320 --> 01:55:40,639
Gonca! Gonca! My daughter!
-Hurry!

1092
01:55:40,720 --> 01:55:42,919
Hurry!

1093
01:55:43,040 --> 01:55:46,159
Come on!
-Mehmet! Tell me! What happened?

1094
01:55:46,160 --> 01:55:48,799
I don't know Alaeddin. He fell
to the ground all of a sudden.

1095
01:55:48,880 --> 01:55:53,199
Come on, father! Hang on!
-Hang on Yakup Bey!

1096
01:55:58,280 --> 01:56:03,279
They disappeared. We could not
find them, Commander Constantine.

1097
01:56:12,040 --> 01:56:16,519
Let them think they ran away.

1098
01:56:18,440 --> 01:56:21,439
I know the path they will take.

1099
01:56:22,600 --> 01:56:26,279
I will kill Osman with my
own hands in tribe Kesis.

1100
01:56:33,920 --> 01:56:36,319
Bring the horses!

1101
01:56:37,760 --> 01:56:38,119
#unrecognized text#

1102
01:56:46,880 --> 01:56:49,759
Clear the way for Trader Christo! Move, soldiers!

1103
01:56:49,880 --> 01:56:53,039
I have to take my goods to my ship!

1104
01:57:08,040 --> 01:57:12,039
My Bey, who is Christo? -Christo was a master.

1105
01:57:12,200 --> 01:57:16,279
I was his undermaster. Then we became companions.

1106
01:57:46,680 --> 01:57:50,759
We'll start after the people
calm down. Be careful.

1107
01:57:52,120 --> 01:57:54,999
Tugay. Husrev.
You'll stay a bit longer.

1108
01:57:55,080 --> 01:57:57,119
You'll wait for Osman Bey's orders.

1109
01:57:57,320 --> 01:58:00,799
Be careful, do not let them notice you.
-Don't worry, Cerkutay Bey.

1110
01:58:00,880 --> 01:58:03,039
For sure we'll take care of it.

1111
01:58:03,120 --> 01:58:05,999
Come on Alps... We will go
and get rid of these clothes.

1112
01:58:06,320 --> 01:58:10,079
Come on... -Come on.

1113
01:58:18,800 --> 01:58:21,719
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

1114
01:58:25,600 --> 01:58:29,559
Come on, Yakup Bey.. Come on.

1115
01:58:43,480 --> 01:58:47,959
Father... Father...
Father... let us help you.

1116
01:58:48,080 --> 01:58:51,359
Father please wake up! Father...

1117
01:58:51,520 --> 01:58:56,879
Father...

1118
01:59:01,120 --> 01:59:05,999
Father. Father... Father...

1119
01:59:12,720 --> 01:59:18,399
Father... Father... Father..

1120
01:59:19,080 --> 01:59:24,119
Father... Father!

1121
01:59:25,200 --> 01:59:28,959
Father... Father...

1122
01:59:31,080 --> 01:59:33,559
Father..

1123
01:59:34,760 --> 01:59:37,159
Father, please, wake up!

1124
01:59:37,880 --> 01:59:42,479
Father! Father! Please, wake up!

1125
01:59:42,760 --> 01:59:45,519
Please, wake up! Please!

1126
01:59:46,160 --> 01:59:50,639
Take Gonca outside.
-My rose... Come on my rose...

1127
01:59:52,040 --> 01:59:55,039
Come on my Gonca.
-Come on Gonca.

1128
02:00:05,800 --> 02:00:09,399
Come on, Yakup Bey. Hang on.

1129
02:00:09,720 --> 02:00:13,199
Hang on, Yakup Bey.

1130
02:00:23,200 --> 02:00:25,239
Gonca..

1131
02:00:30,920 --> 02:00:33,759
Don't cry, Gonca.

1132
02:00:34,160 --> 02:00:37,639
My father is strong.
He will get over this.

1133
02:00:38,240 --> 02:00:41,359
He is Germiyanoglu Yakup Bey.

1134
02:00:43,160 --> 02:00:47,919
How did this happen? Huh? Was my father sick?

1135
02:00:48,520 --> 02:00:50,959
Since we went to Kutahya, he wouldn't...

1136
02:00:51,040 --> 02:00:54,399
...eat, he wouldn't sleep.

1137
02:00:55,880 --> 02:00:58,559
He was in sorrow inside,
but he didn't make it apparent.

1138
02:00:59,240 --> 02:01:06,039
It is all because of me.

1139
02:01:06,160 --> 02:01:10,039
-It is all because of me.
-No, my daughter.

1140
02:01:10,160 --> 02:01:14,319
Gonca, don't put this on your heart too.

1141
02:01:14,640 --> 02:01:16,599
Allah gives and takes everything.

1142
02:01:16,680 --> 02:01:20,319
With Allah's permission, he
will heal with Alaeddin's help.

1143
02:01:20,440 --> 02:01:23,159
I hope so.

1144
02:01:23,680 --> 02:01:25,839
Mehmed

1145
02:01:26,040 --> 02:01:30,079
Well done by bringing him here.

1146
02:01:38,120 --> 02:01:41,959
May Allah cures him.

1147
02:01:42,040 --> 02:01:46,359
Drink something, come on.

1148
02:01:46,360 --> 02:01:46,999
#unrecognized text#

1149
02:01:47,120 --> 02:01:49,639
Thank you, Elcim Hatun.

1150
02:01:52,000 --> 02:01:56,359
My Allah, help me.

1151
02:01:58,320 --> 02:02:01,319
My Allah, please help me.

1152
02:02:04,000 --> 02:02:06,319
My Allah.

1153
02:02:12,760 --> 02:02:13,199
#unrecognized text#

1154
02:02:34,520 --> 02:02:36,999
So, Nikola you said, Osman Bey.

1155
02:02:37,080 --> 02:02:38,319
You tricked me good.

1156
02:02:38,440 --> 02:02:41,439
They were saying cunning and honest about you.

1157
02:02:41,880 --> 02:02:44,719
-So it was true.
-May you prosper.

1158
02:02:44,960 --> 02:02:47,919
May you prosper, you
risked your life for us as well.

1159
02:02:48,000 --> 02:02:50,959
I didn't put it in danger just for you.

1160
02:02:51,600 --> 02:02:54,239
I put it in danger for Bursa as well.

1161
02:02:56,120 --> 02:02:58,559
I know your intentions, Osman Bey.

1162
02:02:58,680 --> 02:03:00,879
There is no justice left in Bursa.

1163
02:03:01,040 --> 02:03:04,959
I've heard about the justice you
provide in the lands you conquered.

1164
02:03:05,040 --> 02:03:07,159
This is not easy to say, however..

1165
02:03:07,520 --> 02:03:11,679
..people of Bursa are
waiting for you to save them..

1166
02:03:11,680 --> 02:03:14,919
..where there is injustice happening.

1167
02:03:17,760 --> 02:03:21,399
-I am one of them.
-Alright.

1168
02:03:21,480 --> 02:03:23,559
You saved my life also.

1169
02:03:23,640 --> 02:03:28,639
Looters couldn't get to my shop
again. Now I saved your life in return.

1170
02:03:28,720 --> 02:03:31,559
I don't like being in debt,
Osman Bey. Now we are even.

1171
02:03:31,640 --> 02:03:34,759
I know. Don't worry.

1172
02:03:34,960 --> 02:03:38,039
However, you should go back.
They shouldn't see you with us.

1173
02:03:38,240 --> 02:03:43,399
I will need you. Travel safe.

1174
02:04:02,680 --> 02:04:06,079
Everything is set, my Bey.

1175
02:04:06,280 --> 02:04:08,479
We are waiting for your orders.

1176
02:04:08,560 --> 02:04:12,599
Thank you, Solgur Agha. Let Konstantin come.

1177
02:04:12,720 --> 02:04:16,239
The route we will take will be his end.

1178
02:04:16,520 --> 02:04:20,079
If Allah permits, my Bey.

1179
02:04:20,200 --> 02:04:23,039
They are many, however, we will deal with them.

1180
02:04:23,440 --> 02:04:28,879
They are many, but we are Turks. Come on.

1181
02:04:50,560 --> 02:04:52,719
Alaeddin.

1182
02:04:53,000 --> 02:04:56,319
-Alaeddin, my father.
-His heart got under pressure.

1183
02:04:56,680 --> 02:05:00,599
His breath was weak when I came too.

1184
02:05:01,160 --> 02:05:05,839
Will my father be alright?
You cured my father before.

1185
02:05:06,520 --> 02:05:08,599
He became weak, Mehmed.

1186
02:05:08,880 --> 02:05:13,119
I will prepare him a medicine, he
will be back on his feet, if Allah permits.

1187
02:05:13,200 --> 02:05:16,519
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

1188
02:05:17,200 --> 02:05:20,359
He will be alright, right Alaeddin?

1189
02:05:26,000 --> 02:05:29,799
You are lying to not make me upset.

1190
02:05:29,960 --> 02:05:32,999
-Alaeddin will he be alright?
-My Gonca.

1191
02:05:33,160 --> 02:05:35,399
We are doing the best we can.

1192
02:05:35,440 --> 02:05:37,239
We will pray and he will be alright.

1193
02:05:37,760 --> 02:05:41,959
-He will.
-He will.

1194
02:05:42,760 --> 02:05:46,199
Tell me what you need, Alaeddin.

1195
02:05:46,320 --> 02:05:47,759
Just cure my father.

1196
02:05:48,040 --> 02:05:52,639
The only thing we need is time,
Mehmed. I can handle the rest.

1197
02:05:57,280 --> 02:06:00,839
I've brought my father here, as
there were no other healers, know that.

1198
02:06:01,160 --> 02:06:04,199
If he is lying in there now,
you are the reason, Alaeddin.

1199
02:06:04,240 --> 02:06:07,199
-Don't start, Mehmed.
-You shouldn't have taken my sister..

1200
02:06:07,360 --> 02:06:10,719
..if you didn't make her an enemy of my
father, none of this would've happened.

1201
02:06:10,840 --> 02:06:14,039
All this happened because
of you. You will cure my father.

1202
02:06:14,120 --> 02:06:16,999
-Or..
-Enough, brother.

1203
02:06:17,080 --> 02:06:20,559
-Enough!
-Not enough!

1204
02:06:20,680 --> 02:06:23,479
Both of you caused my father ill.

1205
02:06:23,720 --> 02:06:27,679
-You are crossing the line, Mehmed.
-What if I do?

1206
02:06:33,360 --> 02:06:36,079
-My Gonca! -Alaeddin!

1207
02:06:36,320 --> 02:06:38,959
-Are you alright, Gonca?
-Alaeddin, to the tent!

1208
02:06:39,080 --> 02:06:41,199
-Sister!
-To the tent!

1209
02:06:41,320 --> 02:06:44,199
Come on, Gonca.

1210
02:06:44,560 --> 02:06:47,479
Gonca, are you alright?

1211
02:06:47,680 --> 02:06:50,879
You will be alright.

1212
02:07:07,200 --> 02:07:09,839
Everything is ready, Commander Konstantin.

1213
02:07:10,320 --> 02:07:13,919
This is the route Holofira mentioned.

1214
02:07:15,240 --> 02:07:18,319
Osman will not leave here alive.

1215
02:07:18,400 --> 02:07:21,999
This road will be his end.

1216
02:07:44,400 --> 02:07:48,559
We'll use the route that
Holofira told Constantin about.

1217
02:07:50,680 --> 02:07:55,439
Why go into the trap knowingly, my Bey?

1218
02:07:56,720 --> 02:07:59,799
Aren't we famous for walking
into the traps, Solgur Agha?

1219
02:07:59,960 --> 02:08:05,519
We aren't only famous for walking
into traps but also for ruining the traps.

1220
02:08:05,600 --> 02:08:07,319
Exactly.

1221
02:08:08,960 --> 02:08:13,559
Constantin's father and
Holofira's father are brothers.

1222
02:08:13,840 --> 02:08:19,079
Constantin will show no mercy to Holofira.

1223
02:08:21,080 --> 02:08:25,799
For this reason, if we don't go
through the route Holofira mentioned,

1224
02:08:27,360 --> 02:08:30,519
...that won't be good for Holofira.

1225
02:08:35,640 --> 02:08:40,519
Today, our first move will
be getting out of Bursa alive!

1226
02:08:41,120 --> 02:08:45,839
In this way, we will protect Holofira's life.

1227
02:08:47,200 --> 02:08:50,399
What are you planning, my Bey?

1228
02:09:01,240 --> 02:09:05,559
Commander Constantin. Osman is coming alone.

1229
02:09:07,000 --> 02:09:09,239
Be ready!

1230
02:09:10,360 --> 02:09:13,639
I will take his life.

1231
02:09:40,000 --> 02:09:43,959
I will make those who did
this to you pay for this, father.

1232
02:09:45,360 --> 02:09:50,119
They took first my sister
and then the market from us.

1233
02:09:50,800 --> 02:09:55,599
Both Osman and Alaaddin will pay for this.

1234
02:09:59,840 --> 02:10:02,119
-Kanyumaz!
-My Shahzade.

1235
02:10:02,400 --> 02:10:04,159
Stay with my father.

1236
02:10:04,320 --> 02:10:08,399
-I will go check Gonca.
-As you order, my Shahzade.

1237
02:10:32,440 --> 02:10:34,519
Elcim Hatun.

1238
02:10:36,240 --> 02:10:39,719
You seem to regret what you said to Gonca Hatun.

1239
02:10:40,720 --> 02:10:43,679
You're angry with me too, Ulgen?

1240
02:10:43,960 --> 02:10:47,639
No way. You are a Kayi bride.

1241
02:10:48,080 --> 02:10:50,999
-Who am I to be angry with me?
-Estaghfirullah.

1242
02:10:51,280 --> 02:10:55,319
We are one. We share bread.

1243
02:10:56,960 --> 02:11:01,439
Tell me. Did I go too far?

1244
02:11:02,440 --> 02:11:04,759
You did.

1245
02:11:05,840 --> 02:11:08,679
But you aren't angry with Gonca.

1246
02:11:08,960 --> 02:11:13,279
You are upset because Orhan Bey has gone to Bursa.

1247
02:11:20,280 --> 02:11:22,559
Yes, I got jealous.

1248
02:11:22,920 --> 02:11:26,479
-Because Holofira is in Bursa.
-Elcim Hatun.

1249
02:11:28,080 --> 02:11:30,919
I don't have a position to give you advice.

1250
02:11:31,480 --> 02:11:35,399
But Holofira is risking her life for Osman Bey.

1251
02:11:36,080 --> 02:11:38,399
She's a spy in Bursa.

1252
02:11:38,800 --> 02:11:40,479
And Orhan Bey does...

1253
02:11:40,600 --> 02:11:43,319
...whatever you want.

1254
02:11:45,800 --> 02:11:48,839
Don't be upset in vain.

1255
02:12:10,120 --> 02:12:13,199
Holofira is a spy, huh?

1256
02:12:13,680 --> 02:12:18,279
Osman... Now I got you.

1257
02:13:15,240 --> 02:13:17,639
Welcome, Osman Bey.

1258
02:13:18,000 --> 02:13:21,839
What? Are you surprised?

1259
02:13:22,280 --> 02:13:25,999
Weren't you expecting to see me?

1260
02:13:53,720 --> 02:13:57,639
You escaped from Bursa.

1261
02:14:01,200 --> 02:14:04,119
But you can't escape from me now, Osman.

1262
02:14:10,720 --> 02:14:13,999
You laid a vile ambush for me, huh?

1263
02:14:17,840 --> 02:14:23,399
And now you're even showing
your teeth behind your soldiers!

1264
02:14:26,360 --> 02:14:32,239
Soldiers, tell me! Is this the
command who everybody praises?

1265
02:14:36,040 --> 02:14:39,199
Is your manhood only this much?

1266
02:14:43,920 --> 02:14:46,759
Here I am, Osman!

1267
02:14:48,360 --> 02:14:50,159
One on one!

1268
02:14:50,400 --> 02:14:54,039
Do you have courage to fight me?

1269
02:15:19,440 --> 02:15:23,879
Well... This is the field of reality!

1270
02:15:24,640 --> 02:15:29,399
We'll see who will survive and who will die!

1271
02:15:32,080 --> 02:15:34,359
I will cut off your head...

1272
02:15:34,640 --> 02:15:38,039
...and hang it on the city walls of Bursa, Osman!

1273
02:16:01,560 --> 02:16:05,879
Come to me. Come.

1274
02:16:07,920 --> 02:16:10,799
-Yes!
-Come on!

1275
02:16:20,960 --> 02:16:23,279
Oh Allah!

1276
02:16:25,937 --> 02:16:36,807
Visit turkision.com for more!